<title>MALAYSIA: Angkasa to buy China investment firm.</title>
<headline>Angkasa to buy China investment firm.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Angkasa Marketing Bhd said on Monday it has proposed to acquire the entire interest in China Aero-Fund Ltd from China Aeronautical Technology Fund Ltd for $17 million in cash.</p>
<p>China Aero-Fund was established for investing in Nanjing Jincheng Machinery Co Ltd. At present, China Aero-Funds holds a 9.09 percent stake in Nanjing Jincheng.</p>
<p>The proposed acquisition, to be funded by bank borrowing, would increase Angkasa Marketing's equity interest in Nanjing Jincheng to 47.73 percent from 38.64 percent, Angkasa Marketing said in a statement.</p>
<p>Angkasa Merketing distributes Suzuki vehicles in Malaysia.</p>
</text>
